No Certbot source code is included in this repository. The reference is
behavioural only:

  * the on-disk lineage layout (live/, archive/, renewal/) and its field naming,
  * the actual format of renewal/*.conf, including top-level keys written before
    any section header,
  * the semantics of --dry-run and --staging, documented in
    docs/upstream-findings.md for the purpose of contrast.

The LICENSE file in this repository is the Apache License 2.0 text as
